<p>pidar ki mout hai marna jawaan bete ka<br />
safar jahaan se karna jawaan bete ka<br />
ghazab hai khoon me bharna jawaan bete ka<br />
sitam hai ji-se guzarna jawaan bete ka</p>

<p>shabaab tha ke shah-e- mashraqain se choote<br />
mohibbo peeto ke akbar hussain se choote<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>quda pidar ko na dikhlaaye marge raahat-e jaa'n<br />
kaleja zaqmi ho jab dil ko phir qaraar kaha'n<br />
udhar to sina-e akbar se guzri nok-e sinaa'n<br />
lahu idhar huwa chasm-e imaam-e- deen se rawa'n</p>

<p>tadap ke janib-e gardoo'n nigaah ki shah ne<br />
zaameen hilgayi ek aisi aah ki shah ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pukarte huwe doude mere shaheed pisar<br />
mere jawa'n mere mehroo mere saeed pisar<br />
mere hasee'n mere yousuf mere rasheed pisar<br />
qareeb ho kahi'n maida'n se ya baeed pisar</p>

<p>pidar pa aaj nayi waaredaat hai beta<br />
qabar nahi mujhe din hai ke raat hai beta<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kidhar gaye mere gulpairahan ali akbar<br />
mere qaleeq mere kamsuqan ali akbar<br />
jawana marg gharibul watan ali akbar<br />
ujaad kar gaye mera chaman ali akbar</p>

<p>bula ke ghar se yaha'n ashqiya ne loot liya<br />
duhayai hai ke mujhe karbala ne loot liya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pukaarte the ke aye sher phir pukaar mujhe<br />
nahi batane ke laasha ye naabakaar mujhe<br />
tere firaaq me hai zeest naa gawaar mujhe<br />
sadaa sunaade mai sadqe phir ek baar mujhe</p>

<p>gale lagaalo ke seena hamara jalta hai<br />
kaleja mu se koi dam me ab nikalta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pukari deodi se bano pisar mila ke nahi<br />
bataao marham-e zaqme jigar mila ke nahi<br />
sitam ke abr me mera qamar mila ke nahi<br />
ali ke laal wo aali gohar mila ke nahi</p>

<p>shitaab laao mere mannattou ke paale ko<br />
tumhi se loongi mai apne muraad waale ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye zikr tha ke sada aayi door se nagaah<br />
janaab &ndash;e- qibla &ndash;o- kaaba ab aaiye lillah<br />
huzoor haal se bete ke kya nahi aagaah<br />
zabaan ainth gayi hai ghulaam ki ya shah</p>

<p>ukhad raha hai dam ab mout jaan leti hai<br />
pukaarne ki bhi taaqat jawaab deti hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sadaa ye sunte hi sultaan-e- bahrobar doudhe<br />
ye darde dil tha ke thame huwe jigar doudhe<br />
kabhi to fouj pa maaninde sher-e- nar doudhe<br />
kabhi idhar gaye rote kabhi udhar dowdhe</p>

<p>luti huwi wo kamaayi basad talaash mili<br />
zamee'n pa qoon me ghaltaa'n pisar ki laash mili<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ajeeb haalate farzand-e- noujawaa'n dekhi<br />
atash se honto'n pa nikli huwi zabaa'n dekhi<br />
qamar se chehre pa zardi labo'n pa jaa'n dekhi<br />
kaleja phat gaya seene me jab sinaa'n dekhi</p>

<p>pidar ke saamne bete ka dam ukhadta tha<br />
hussain dekhte the aur ghar ujadta tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qareeb lash-e- pisar baith ke ye farmaaye<br />
zameen-e- garm se beta utho ke ham aaye<br />
sadaa ye sunte hi akbar ne haath phailaaye<br />
lipat ke laash se shah lab pa ye suqan laaye</p>

<p>gale lagalo mohammed ka mai nawasa hoon<br />
zabaa'n dikhake kaha ya hussain pyaasa hoon<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye keh ke shaah se khainchi ghareeb ne ek aah<br />
jigar me hone laga dard aah ke hamraah<br />
ajeeb yaas ki nazro'n se dekh kar ruq-e- shaah<br />
kaha ke ash hadu an laa ilaaha illallah</p>

<p>bas aur keh na sake kuch ye haale ghair huwa<br />
sue behisht gaye qatema baqair huwa<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>